  prompt: "A cultural association runs a \"Caffè filosofico\" and publishes short essays online. Answer this month's question in about 350 words of Italian: \"Si può essere felici senza essere liberi?\" Clarify your terms, state a thesis, present and answer one objection, and end with a nuanced conclusion.",
